#------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#   Name            : odchrgcalcmn001.scr
#   Description     : Get ODCharges event id
#   Date            : 10-03-2013
#   Author          : Bharath Reddy B
#   Input           : NA
#   Output          : NA
#   Called Script   :
